+		/*
+		 * WCN6750 additionally needs its BT_EN line asserted; the
+		 * WCN399x parts power up from the regulators alone, which is
+		 * why this branch never touched a GPIO. Without it the chip
+		 * stays down and the very first command times out:
+		 *   Bluetooth: hci0: command 0xfc00 tx timeout
+		 *   Bluetooth: hci0: Reading QCA version information failed (-110)
